      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "팔에 차고 있는 거 메가링이야?\n그게 있으면 메가진화를 시킬 수 있어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D314C5D00020CC28ACE00020C788B2940020AC700020BA54AC00B9C1C774C57C003F000AADF8AC8C0020C788C73CBA740020BA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020C2DCD0AC0020C2180020C788C5B4003F001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시킬 수 있어!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCD0AC0020C2180020C788C5B400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "멋지지?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA4BC9C0C9C0003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우와~! 진짜 굉장하다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0C640007E00210020C9C4C9DC0020AD49C7A5D558B2E40021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼~\n메가진화에 대해서도 잘 알겠네?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC007E000ABA54AC00C9C4D654C5D00020B300D574C11CB3C40020C7980020C54CACA0B124003F001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 트레이너 <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁ형누나한테\n가르쳐 달라고 하자!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020D2B8B808C774B108002000100003110000FF0201D615B204B098D55CD14C000AAC00B974CCD00020B2ECB77CACE00020D558C7900021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그냥 트레이너님이 아니라\n메가진화술사님이잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B0E50020D2B8B808C774B108B2D8C7740020C544B2C8B77C000ABA54AC00C9C4D654C220C0ACB2D8C774C796C5440021001000020114019C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화술사님!\n저희에게 메가진화에 대해 가르쳐 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654C220C0ACB2D80021000AC800D76CC5D0AC8C0020BA54AC00C9C4D654C5D00020B300D5740020AC00B974CCD00020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리 아빠는 퀘이사 주식회사 직원인데도\n나한테 메가링을 안 주는 거 있지!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9AC0020C544BE60B2940020D018C774C0AC0020C8FCC2DDD68CC0AC0020C9C1C6D0C778B370B3C4000AB098D55CD14C0020BA54AC00B9C1C7440020C5480020C8FCB2940020AC700020C788C9C0002100100002011401990000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화는 엄청 인기라구!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654B2940020C5C4CCAD0020C778AE30B77CAD6C0021001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우리 학교 선생님은\n메가진화를 못 시키거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƛ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B9AC0020D559AD500020C120C0DDB2D8C740000ABA54AC00C9C4D654B97C0020BABB0020C2DCD0A4AC70B4E0002E001000020114019B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저도 메가링을 받아서\n파트너를 메가진화시킬 거예요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B3C40020BA54AC00B9C1C7440020BC1BC544C11C000AD30CD2B8B108B97C0020BA54AC00C9C4D654C2DCD0AC0020AC70C608C6940021001000020114019C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화술사님!\n저희에게 특별 수업을 해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654C220C0ACB2D80021000AC800D76CC5D0AC8C0020D2B9BCC40020C218C5C5C7440020D5740020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "수업을 시작하자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C218C5C5C7440020C2DCC791D558C79000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아직 수업 시간이 아니야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C9C10020C218C5C50020C2DCAC04C7740020C544B2C8C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "알았어요!\n얼마든지 기다릴 수 있어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C54CC558C5B4C6940021000AC5BCB9C8B4E0C9C00020AE30B2E4B9B40020C2180020C788C5B4C6940021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아싸! 그럼, 우리가 하나씩 질문할게요!\n먼저 나부터!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C2F800210020ADF8B7FC002C0020C6B0B9ACAC000020D558B098C5290020C9C8BB38D560AC8CC6940021000ABA3CC8000020B098BD80D1300021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화에 필요한 돌은\n뭐라고 불러요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654C5D00020D544C694D55C0020B3CCC740000ABB50B77CACE00020BD88B7ECC694003F001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가나이트",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00B098C774D2B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가스톤",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C2A4D1A40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가록",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00B85D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "멋있긴 하지만,\n그런 이름이 아니었던 거 같은데요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA4BC788AE340020D558C9C0B9CC002C000AADF8B7F00020C774B984C7740020C544B2C8C5C8B3580020AC700020AC19C740B370C694002E002E002E001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화시키는 스톤!\n잘 어울리는 이름이네요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654C2DCD0A4B2940020C2A4D1A40021000AC7980020C5B4C6B8B9ACB2940020C774B984C774B124C6940021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "록은 바위 아니에요?\n그렇게 크진 않았던 거 같은데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B85DC7400020BC14C7040020C544B2C8C5D0C694003F000AADF8B807AC8C0020D06CC9C40020C54AC558B3580020AC700020AC19C740B370002E002E002E001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가스톤은 포켓몬마다 이름이 다르지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƛ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C2A4D1A4C7400020D3ECCF13BAACB9C8B2E40020C774B984C7740020B2E4B974C9C0003F001000020114019B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카나리 언니의 저리더프에게 필요한\n메가스톤은 이름이 뭐야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƛ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B098B9AC0020C5B8B2C8C7580020C800B9ACB354D504C5D0AC8C0020D544C694D55C000ABA54AC00C2A4D1A4C7400020C774B984C7740020BB50C57C003F001000020114019B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저리더프나이트",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B9ACB354D504B098C774D2B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저리덮나이트",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B9ACB36EB098C774D2B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저리더프스나이트",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B9ACB354D504C2A4B098C774D2B80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나이트가 붙는 거구나!\n재미있는 이름이네!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƛ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098C774D2B8AC000020BD99B2940020AC70AD6CB0980021000AC7ACBBF8C788B2940020C774B984C774B1240021001000020114019B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정답은 저리더프나이트잖아...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n포켓몬의 이름을 그대로 쓰지 않는\n메가스톤도 있지만, 저리더프는 아니야.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƛ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B2F5C7400020C800B9ACB354D504B098C774D2B8C796C544002E002E002E00100001BE01000AD3ECCF13BAACC7580020C774B984C7440020ADF8B300B85C0020C4F0C9C00020C54AB294000ABA54AC00C2A4D1A4B3C40020C788C9C0B9CC002C0020C800B9ACB354D504B2940020C544B2C8C57C002E001000020114019B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "‘스’는 없어도 되는 거 아니야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƛ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2018C2A42019B2940020C5C6C5B4B3C40020B418B2940020AC700020C544B2C8C57C003F001000020114019B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음은 내가 물어볼래!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74CC7400020B0B4AC000020BB3CC5B4BCFCB7980021001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화 중일 때는\n기술도 강해진다고 들었는데,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그걸 따로 부르는 이름이 있어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D6540020C911C77C0020B54CB294000AAE30C220B3C40020AC15D574C9C4B2E4ACE00020B4E4C5C8B294B370002C00100001BE00000AADF8AC780020B530B85C0020BD80B974B2940020C774B984C7740020C788C5B4003F001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기술맥스",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C220B9E5C2A40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기술쑥쑥",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C220C465C4650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기술플러스",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C220D50CB7ECC2A40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다이맥스랑\n헷갈린 거 아니야?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C774B9E5C2A4B791000AD5F7AC08B9B00020AC700020C544B2C8C57C003F001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그게 뭐야...\n정말 메가진화술사인 거 맞아?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC8C0020BB50C57C002E002E002E000AC815B9D00020BA54AC00C9C4D654C220C0ACC7780020AC700020B9DEC544003F001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇구나!\n기술이 플러스되는 느낌인 건가?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AD6CB0980021000AAE30C220C7740020D50CB7ECC2A4B418B2940020B290B08CC7780020AC74AC00003F001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화하면\n타입이 바뀌는 포켓몬도 있다고 들었는데,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n어떤 포켓몬인지 알아?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
