      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "딩동댕!\n메가전룡은 드래곤타입이 추가돼.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B529B3D9B3150021000ABA54AC00C804B8E1C7400020B4DCB798ACE4D0C0C785C7740020CD94AC00B3FC002E00100002011401990000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가썬더볼트는\n전기타입 그대로잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C36CB354BCFCD2B8B294000AC804AE30D0C0C7850020ADF8B300B85CC796C544002100100002011401990000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "질문이 너무 마니악하지 않아?\n이번엔 내가 질문할래!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C8BB38C7740020B108BB340020B9C8B2C8C545D558C9C00020C54AC544003F000AC774BC88C5D40020B0B4AC000020C9C8BB38D560B7980021001000020114019C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화술사님은\n어떤 메가진화가 가장 강하다고 생각하세요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654C220C0ACB2D8C740000AC5B4B5A40020BA54AC00C9C4D654AC000020AC00C7A50020AC15D558B2E4ACE00020C0DDAC01D558C138C694003F001000020114019C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가염무왕",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C5FCBB34C6550000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가메가니움",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00BA54AC00B2C8C6C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가장크로다일",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
