      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다들 질문했으니,\n수업은 이만 끝내도록 할까!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4B4E40020C9C8BB38D588C73CB2C8002C000AC218C5C5C7400020C774B9CC0020B05DB0B4B3C4B85D0020D560AE4C0021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가선생님은 메가진화에 대해\n뭐든지 다 아는구나!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C120C0DDB2D8C7400020BA54AC00C9C4D654C5D00020B300D574000ABB50B4E0C9C00020B2E40020C544B294AD6CB0980021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가선생님...\n조금 이상하게 대답한 것도 있지 않았어?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C120C0DDB2D8002E002E002E000AC870AE080020C774C0C1D558AC8C0020B300B2F5D55C0020AC83B3C40020C788C9C00020C54AC558C5B4003F001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전부 잘못된 답을 내서 우리가\n스스로 생각하게 하려는 작전이었던 건가...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C804BD800020C798BABBB41C0020B2F5C7440020B0B4C11C0020C6B0B9ACAC00000AC2A4C2A4B85C0020C0DDAC01D558AC8C0020D558B824B2940020C791C804C774C5C8B3580020AC74AC00002E002E002E003F001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화에 대해\n더 많이 알고 싶어졌어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654C5D00020B300D574000AB3540020B9CEC7740020C54CACE00020C2F6C5B4C84CC5B40021001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나도!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B3C40021001000020114019C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화술사님!\n이런 소문 들어 본 적 있어요?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n최강의 메가진화술사가\n미르를 구할 거래요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕů",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654C220C0ACB2D80021000AC774B7F00020C18CBB380020B4E4C5B40020BCF80020C8010020C788C5B4C694003F00100001BE01000ACD5CAC15C7580020BA54AC00C9C4D654C220C0ACAC00000ABBF8B974B97C0020AD6CD5600020AC70B798C6940021001000020114016F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화는 역시 대단해!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654B2940020C5EDC2DC0020B300B2E8D574002100100002011401990000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "메가진화에 대해\n더 많이 알고 싶어졌어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƚ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA54AC00C9C4D654C5D00020B300D574000AB3540020B9CEC7740020C54CACE00020C2F6C5B4C84CC5B40021001000020114019A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "학교 수업보다 더 재밌었어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƛ",
